  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When using combat spheres and talents granted by a sphereshaper veil, the sphereshaper may use his veilweaving modifier in place of his Strength or Dexterity when making attacks and combat maneuvers and when determining his damage using that sphere or talent.</p>\n<p>They may also use the higher or their base attack bonus or their sphereshaper level when using those spheres or talents, including attack rolls made as part of using a sphere effect.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/sphereshaper#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
